        "id": 171868,
        "name": "seesome",
        "username": "seesome",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-12T13:58:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh yeah!&nbsp; I'm a big fan of Empowered and have been buying it in print since the first volume (I've been a fan of Adam Warren since his run on the Dirty Pair comics).&nbsp; In the beginning, it's obviously just him having fun with kinky damsel-in-distress tropes, but as the series goes on it turns into some very interesting commentary about the tropes themselves and how that effects the characters.&nbsp; Powerful, heart-breaking stuff.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
