        "id": 171869,
        "name": "ViolentSilence",
        "username": "ViolentSilence",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/bbe5ce/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-13T00:30:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's slightly frustrating having only just found it, raced through all the stories (apart from the 7th one-shot) and now I'm impatiently waiting for volume 10 to come next year. I can't think of many things that have moved me as much as some of the character arcs (Les Mis, Stranger than Fiction, messages scene from Interstellar, Inside Out.... It's in pretty good company!). The chapter where a character drops their usual style of speech was surprisingly beautiful and completely unexepected and I think it's the ability to switch that really impresses me</p>",
